<title>NEW ZEALAND: Heinz sells NZ Tip Top icecream business.</title>
<headline>Heinz sells NZ Tip Top icecream business.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S.-based foods group H.J. Heinz Company said on Wednesday it had reached a definitive agreement to sell its New Zealand-based icecream business, Tip Top, to  Peters and Brownes Ltd of Perth, Australia.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not released.</p>
</text>
